## Native components

These are statically linked into single per-role Android shared objects that
ship inside the APK's `lib/<abi>/` directory. Rebuild instructions live in the
directories that own each component (`native/sqlite/README.md`,
`native/llama/README.md`).

### SQLCipher

- **Repository:** https://github.com/sqlcipher/sqlcipher
- **Version:** 4.17.0 (tarball sha256 pinned in
  `native/sqlite/sqlcipher.sha256`)
- **License:** BSD-3-Clause (Zetetic LLC)
- **Where it ships:** statically compiled from the amalgamation into
  `libskein_sqlite.so`; provides the SQLite core plus the page-level
  encryption codec.
- **Attribution:** Copyright (c) 2008-2024 Zetetic LLC — see
  `native/sqlite/third_party/sqlcipher-4.17.0/LICENSE.md` (regenerated from
  the tarball on demand; the amalgamation output `native/sqlite/amalgamation/`
  is a byte-for-byte derivative).

### SQLite core (amalgamated inside SQLCipher)

- **Repository:** https://sqlite.org
- **Version:** 3.53.3 (bundled inside SQLCipher 4.17.0)
- **License:** Public domain
- **Where it ships:** statically compiled inside `libskein_sqlite.so` via the
